      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Overview",
      "contextAfter": "Given a [`CFURL`](cfurl.md) object that holds either a file or http URL, you can read the resource’s data with the [`CFURLCreateDataAndPropertiesFromResource(_:_:_:_:_:_:)`](cfurlcreatedataandpropertiesfromresource(_:_:_:_:_:_:).md) function.",
