      "blockId": "paragraph:overview:0004",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Given a [`CFURL`](cfurl.md) object that holds either a file or http URL, you can read the resource’s data with the [`CFURLCreateDataAndPropertiesFromResource(_:_:_:_:_:_:)`](cfurlcreatedataandpropertiesfromresource(_:_:_:_:_:_:).md) function.",
      "normalizedSource": "Given a [`CFURL`](cfurl.md) object that holds either a file or http URL, you can read the resource’s data with the [`CFURLCreateDataAndPropertiesFromResource(_:_:_:_:_:_:)`](cfurlcreatedataandpropertiesfromresource(_:_:_:_:_:_:).md) function.",
